WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:43.849
=Episode 23=

01:44.520 --> 01:46.800
Huan'er, Huan'er, come quick.

01:46.800 --> 01:48.279
Hello, sir.

01:48.319 --> 01:49.240
I'm Gao Haiming,

01:49.360 --> 01:50.279
Huan'er's boyfriend.

01:54.919 --> 01:56.360
Great, great.

01:59.440 --> 02:01.800
This wine has been stored for years.

02:02.399 --> 02:04.399
I bought it when Huan'er
was in elementary school.

02:04.479 --> 02:05.039
Really?

02:05.240 --> 02:05.919
- Come on.
- Okay.

02:06.319 --> 02:07.039
- Here.
- Thank you, sir.

02:07.080 --> 02:08.599
Today is New Year's Eve.

02:08.960 --> 02:10.999
And it's Gao's first time at our home.

02:11.640 --> 02:13.760
Today, we two must finish it off.

02:13.760 --> 02:14.879
Sure, no problem.

02:14.999 --> 02:16.439
- Come on, cheers.
- Come on.

02:16.719 --> 02:17.320
Happy New Year!

02:17.320 --> 02:19.080
Happy New Year!

02:27.999 --> 02:28.599
Sir,

02:28.839 --> 02:30.559
I've prepared a little gift for you.

02:31.719 --> 02:32.999
You didn't have to.

02:33.119 --> 02:34.439
Why bring a gift?

02:35.080 --> 02:35.839
Take a look first.

02:39.200 --> 02:41.040
How did you know I like this thing?

02:41.200 --> 02:42.200
Huan'er told me.

02:43.960 --> 02:44.839
Great.

02:44.839 --> 02:45.999
Le'er, here's one for you.

02:46.960 --> 02:47.760
Here.

02:49.040 --> 02:49.760
Take a look.

02:49.879 --> 02:51.279
There's a camera inside.

02:51.719 --> 02:54.719
I remember
you like to study plant growth.

02:54.719 --> 02:56.480
You won't have to draw
to record anymore.

02:56.520 --> 02:57.839
Plant growth changes very fast.

02:58.080 --> 03:00.200
Now you can record it
anytime and anywhere.

03:00.879 --> 03:01.879
Thank you, Haiming.

03:02.200 --> 03:03.599
Did Huan'er tell you this too?

03:04.719 --> 03:06.119
It's because I can foretell things.

03:06.520 --> 03:08.719
True. Huan'er doesn't observe me
that carefully.

03:09.559 --> 03:11.559
You're being smug
after getting a bargain, huh?

03:11.760 --> 03:13.999
Right. There are also tangyuan.

03:14.200 --> 03:15.520
I forgot the tangyuan.

03:15.520 --> 03:16.399
Let me help you.

03:16.399 --> 03:17.279
No need.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.999
In the south during the New Year,

03:21.119 --> 03:23.360
we must eat tangyuan.

03:23.719 --> 03:25.760
It symbolizes family reunion

03:26.520 --> 03:27.399
and sweetness.

03:27.879 --> 03:29.839
It brings good luck for the coming year.

03:30.559 --> 03:31.080
Okay.

03:31.240 --> 03:32.999
Just like Huan'er and Haiming,

03:32.999 --> 03:33.920
sweet and loving.

03:35.040 --> 03:35.960
That's a bit gross.

03:36.480 --> 03:37.480
Try these ribs.

03:37.480 --> 03:38.159
Thank you, sir.

03:38.399 --> 03:40.559
This is my best dish.

03:40.879 --> 03:41.679
Huan'er and Le'er

03:41.920 --> 03:44.320
love my ribs the most. Eat more.

03:44.320 --> 03:44.679
Okay.

03:45.240 --> 03:45.800
Huan'er.

03:48.159 --> 03:49.200
Give it to me.

03:49.200 --> 03:50.240
You're eating it for her.

03:50.839 --> 03:51.679
Thank you, sir.

03:51.679 --> 03:52.599
That's enough.

03:53.119 --> 03:53.920
- Enough.
- Here.

03:53.999 --> 03:54.760
Le'er.

03:56.320 --> 03:56.960
Gao,

03:57.679 --> 04:00.200
what's your position in the company now?

04:01.559 --> 04:03.439
Well, I'm in management.

04:05.360 --> 04:06.480
- Management?
- Yes.

04:07.480 --> 04:09.360
Then you have to work hard.

04:10.159 --> 04:13.200
Huan'er is now
the CEO's special assistant, isn't she?

04:13.200 --> 04:15.800
In the future,
you two should help each other

04:16.000 --> 04:16.919
and progress together.

04:17.680 --> 04:18.479
Don't worry.

04:19.320 --> 04:20.279
I promise you.

04:21.479 --> 04:22.919
I will definitely work hard.

04:23.440 --> 04:26.279
I will never
let Huan'er suffer any grievance.

04:26.799 --> 04:28.120
If she is even a little unhappy,

04:28.120 --> 04:29.159
it will be my fault.

04:29.560 --> 04:31.080
I won't let her shed a single tear.

04:31.200 --> 04:32.599
You can absolutely rest assured.

04:32.960 --> 04:33.760
Gao,

04:34.680 --> 04:35.960
with your words,

04:37.000 --> 04:38.359
I am relieved.

04:39.880 --> 04:41.960
I'll go clean up a bit more.

04:41.960 --> 04:42.520
Alright.

04:42.680 --> 04:43.200
Drink tea.

04:43.200 --> 04:43.799
Okay.

04:43.839 --> 04:44.640
Take your time.

04:44.839 --> 04:45.359
Okay.

04:51.479 --> 04:52.120
Done talking?

04:54.560 --> 04:55.799
What did you talk about?

04:56.760 --> 04:57.864
What do you want to hear?

04:58.799 --> 05:00.680
Just tell me what you talked about.

05:00.960 --> 05:02.239
Whatever you wish to hear,

05:02.799 --> 05:04.560
I'll slowly tell you.

05:09.120 --> 05:09.760
Lin Le'er.

05:23.200 --> 05:23.960
I'm so tired.

05:24.359 --> 05:26.000
My legs are sore from shopping.

05:27.080 --> 05:27.960
Let's sit for a while.

05:31.960 --> 05:32.440
Come on.

05:34.760 --> 05:35.560
If you like it,

05:35.560 --> 05:36.799
we can go back tomorrow, okay?

05:42.440 --> 05:43.520
This is?

05:44.359 --> 05:45.919
Well, Huan'er.

05:46.760 --> 05:47.320
Wait.

05:48.440 --> 05:49.120
Wait.

05:51.479 --> 05:52.799
I feel a bit thirsty.

05:52.799 --> 05:54.279
I'll cut some fruit for you.

06:03.839 --> 06:04.320
Mom.

06:04.799 --> 06:05.440
Haiming,

06:05.839 --> 06:07.320
did Huan'er like the earrings

06:07.320 --> 06:08.200
I bought her?

06:08.520 --> 06:09.320
I haven't given her.

06:09.599 --> 06:11.239
Then give them to her quickly.

06:11.399 --> 06:13.479
They're my New Year's gift for Huan'er.

06:14.279 --> 06:14.880
I know.

06:24.120 --> 06:26.239
(He was about to propose to me, right?)

06:26.839 --> 06:28.200
(That was close.)

06:28.479 --> 06:29.760
(Good thing I held him back.)

06:31.960 --> 06:32.599
Huan'er.

06:33.239 --> 06:33.719
These...

06:36.359 --> 06:38.599
These earrings are from my mom
for the New Year.

06:40.560 --> 06:41.960
Why didn't you say so earlier?

06:42.440 --> 06:43.599
I didn't get a chance.

06:47.120 --> 06:47.912
Do you like them?

06:48.440 --> 06:49.399
I do. They're pretty.

06:51.279 --> 06:53.039
Why are you eating it yourself?

06:53.039 --> 06:54.159
Isn't that for me?

07:16.680 --> 07:17.239
Let's go.

07:29.440 --> 07:30.239
Wait here for me.

07:43.239 --> 07:46.279
Is there some event
happening here today?

07:48.399 --> 07:49.760
Huan'er, actually I brought you...

07:49.760 --> 07:50.919
Aren't these forget-me-nots?

07:53.919 --> 07:54.839
They're so beautiful.

07:55.799 --> 07:56.960
So many forget-me-nots.

07:59.680 --> 08:00.799
We should've brought back

08:00.799 --> 08:02.640
the pot we planted in Lvcheng ourselves.

08:03.039 --> 08:04.799
I wonder if they've sprouted yet.

08:05.200 --> 08:06.640
They should be growing well.

08:06.664 --> 08:10.632
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

08:10.632 --> 08:14.762
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

08:17.080 --> 08:18.120
If there's an event here,

08:18.120 --> 08:19.399
we shouldn't be here today.

08:19.560 --> 08:20.279
Let's go now.

08:20.839 --> 08:21.399
Huan'er.

08:27.560 --> 08:31.640
I think you know
why I brought you here today.

08:33.359 --> 08:34.800
You don't want to be with me?

08:35.560 --> 08:36.519
It's not like that.

08:37.839 --> 08:39.560
I know what you want to say.

08:41.320 --> 08:43.320
To be honest,
I'm looking forward to it too.

08:44.599 --> 08:46.200
But can it not be now?

08:47.999 --> 08:49.080
What are you afraid of?

08:50.239 --> 08:50.920
Getting married?

08:51.400 --> 08:53.160
We can face anything together.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.800
I don't know how to tell you,

08:59.839 --> 09:01.119
but please believe me,

09:01.560 --> 09:03.280
I just want to be with you

09:03.759 --> 09:04.599
for a bit longer.

09:07.800 --> 09:09.119
Even for just one more day.

09:13.512 --> 09:17.320
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

09:18.759 --> 09:19.519
Gao Haiming,

09:20.320 --> 09:21.200
on New Year's Eve,

09:23.239 --> 09:24.440
propose to me, okay?

09:24.999 --> 09:26.160
Why that day?

09:28.119 --> 09:29.280
Haven't you heard?

09:30.719 --> 09:34.160
The world will end
the moment New Year's Eve arrives.

09:34.999 --> 09:37.320
(If you propose then,)

09:37.999 --> 09:39.999
(I'd have no regrets
even if the world ends.)

09:40.485 --> 09:48.508
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

09:48.508 --> 09:55.759
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

09:55.759 --> 09:56.359
Fear not.

09:58.839 --> 09:59.999
Even if only one day is left,

10:05.239 --> 10:06.239
it's better than forever.

10:32.599 --> 10:33.519
Dear Player,

10:33.800 --> 10:36.359
for you repeatedly obstructing
Gao Haiming's proposal,

10:36.519 --> 10:38.479
we are now forcibly
entering the countdown phase.

10:38.879 --> 10:39.800
What does that mean?

10:41.119 --> 10:42.200
Count... countdown?

10:42.719 --> 10:44.920
You have entered a 72-hour countdown.

10:45.040 --> 10:47.759
You must get Gao Haiming's proposal
within 72 hours

10:47.839 --> 10:48.719
and leave this book.

10:48.759 --> 10:50.599
Otherwise, the worlds of everyone

10:50.599 --> 10:52.759
connected to you will begin to collapse.

11:17.359 --> 11:19.160
(Since nothing can be changed,)

11:20.200 --> 11:24.040
(let's just enjoy these last 72 hours.)

11:25.576 --> 11:28.559
♪Entwined worries linger♪

11:29.768 --> 11:32.539
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

11:34.440 --> 11:40.353
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

11:42.150 --> 11:45.210
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

11:46.376 --> 11:49.828
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

11:50.824 --> 11:56.350
♪Until the world's end♪

11:58.239 --> 11:58.639
Come on.

11:59.119 --> 11:59.879
What a feast.

12:00.560 --> 12:01.519
I made them all.

12:02.440 --> 12:03.280
Why were you up early

12:03.280 --> 12:03.999
to cook for me?

12:04.200 --> 12:05.359
Today,

12:06.040 --> 12:06.800
I'm in a good mood.

12:07.960 --> 12:08.920
Try it.

12:09.160 --> 12:09.680
Okay.

12:10.280 --> 12:11.160
I made the fried egg

12:11.479 --> 12:12.879
with a runny yolk.

12:13.080 --> 12:13.960
See if it's good.

12:14.320 --> 12:14.800
Okay.

12:18.119 --> 12:18.680
Is it good?

12:18.960 --> 12:20.680
Yes, it's better than what I make.

12:21.160 --> 12:21.999
Really?

12:22.479 --> 12:22.920
Really.

12:24.119 --> 12:25.599
Are you busy with work this week?

12:27.200 --> 12:27.960
You have any plans?

12:34.719 --> 12:35.440
Gao Haiming,

12:37.560 --> 12:41.040
could you propose to me
the night after tomorrow?

12:44.400 --> 12:45.719
Why the sudden change of heart?

12:46.239 --> 12:48.400
- I thought you were unwilling.
- I'm not unwilling.

12:49.920 --> 12:54.200
I just... I just need some time
to be prepared.

12:57.359 --> 13:00.200
I'll definitely be ready
by the night after tomorrow.

13:09.999 --> 13:10.599
Okay.

13:13.719 --> 13:14.400
Let's eat.

13:15.800 --> 13:16.239
Let's eat.

13:24.239 --> 13:25.719
What's the special occasion today?

13:25.999 --> 13:27.400
Treating us to such a lavish meal?

13:29.800 --> 13:31.519
Mengmeng loves this restaurant.

13:31.759 --> 13:33.080
We thought you should try it too.

13:33.800 --> 13:36.519
You're trying out the menu
for the wedding in advance,

13:36.960 --> 13:37.560
right?

13:40.879 --> 13:42.239
Yes.

13:42.839 --> 13:44.839
We're planning to hold the wedding here.

13:45.479 --> 13:46.879
We wanted you to try the food.

13:47.479 --> 13:48.080
Exactly.

13:48.400 --> 13:51.479
And it can let you know
the wedding procedures ahead of time.

13:52.680 --> 13:53.680
Well, congratulations.

13:53.680 --> 13:55.519
I guess I'm drinking
the wedding wine early.

13:57.879 --> 13:59.639
Can you drink today?

14:00.200 --> 14:00.839
I can.

14:01.080 --> 14:02.359
My captain gave permission.

14:02.920 --> 14:04.560
Then let's go see a movie later.

14:05.080 --> 14:06.999
Okay, whatever you want to do.

14:08.479 --> 14:09.080
Fill it up.

14:10.160 --> 14:10.719
Okay.

14:16.320 --> 14:16.680
Thanks.

14:16.680 --> 14:18.440
Mengmeng, I'm really happy for you.

14:20.519 --> 14:21.080
Huan'er,

14:21.599 --> 14:23.200
shouldn't you be getting on with it too?

14:23.960 --> 14:25.479
Yeah, Mr. Gao,

14:25.680 --> 14:27.359
you're lagging behind a bit.

14:28.359 --> 14:29.999
We're getting there soon.

14:31.119 --> 14:31.920
Then I'll be waiting

14:31.920 --> 14:33.359
to eat your wedding cake.

14:33.920 --> 14:35.759
Come on. Congratulations.

14:36.440 --> 14:37.160
Congratulations.

14:48.999 --> 14:49.599
Huan'er,

14:49.719 --> 14:52.040
let's go try on
wedding dresses later, okay?

14:53.800 --> 14:54.400
Sure.

14:54.879 --> 14:56.440
I'll definitely help you pick out

14:56.759 --> 14:58.040
the most dazzling one.

15:01.719 --> 15:02.479
Eat more.

15:02.560 --> 15:03.999
See how their food is.

15:15.560 --> 15:19.040
Do you believe I have the power
to foresee the future?

15:22.400 --> 15:23.040
Go on.

15:24.200 --> 15:25.119
What can you foresee?

15:26.440 --> 15:29.320
I can foresee that your career
will be very successful.

15:30.040 --> 15:31.519
That's because I work hard, okay?

15:31.879 --> 15:33.080
I can also foresee

15:33.440 --> 15:35.200
that Dr. Wei will be amazing
in the future.

15:35.839 --> 15:37.320
She's already amazing now.

15:38.719 --> 15:39.879
I really can foresee it.

15:41.999 --> 15:43.519
Be serious and listen to me.

15:43.839 --> 15:44.800
Okay, go ahead.

15:46.759 --> 15:49.519
I sense something terrible
will happen tomorrow.

15:50.359 --> 15:51.560
Can you do me a favor

15:52.040 --> 15:53.400
and keep Tiehan with us?

15:54.359 --> 15:55.119
Just for one day.

15:56.119 --> 15:59.239
I want to make sure
he safely marries Mengmeng.

16:11.359 --> 16:11.920
Okay.

16:23.560 --> 16:24.320
Hello, Huan'er?

16:24.879 --> 16:25.479
Tiehan,

16:25.999 --> 16:27.440
did you request leave today?

16:28.160 --> 16:28.839
Leave?

16:29.160 --> 16:30.879
Yes, Haiming said you asked him

16:30.999 --> 16:33.040
to check the wedding hotel
for you this afternoon.

16:34.680 --> 16:35.599
I told him.

16:35.719 --> 16:36.560
I'll go after work.

16:36.560 --> 16:37.839
He can take a look first for me.

16:38.599 --> 16:40.280
You shouldn't leave that job to him.

16:40.280 --> 16:41.800
What if Mengmeng doesn't like it?

16:41.800 --> 16:43.119
I think you need to go yourself.

16:44.080 --> 16:45.999
I really have something at work.

16:46.639 --> 16:48.744
It's Mengmeng's dream perfect wedding.

16:48.744 --> 16:50.440
I think you must cooperate regardless.

16:50.479 --> 16:51.519
You must go yourself.

16:51.519 --> 16:52.800
Hurry up and ask for leave.

16:53.960 --> 16:55.040
I'll cooperate.

16:55.879 --> 16:57.719
I'll ask for leave right away.

16:57.999 --> 16:59.800
Alright, hurry and ask for leave. Bye.

17:06.360 --> 17:08.440
These are our current bestsellers.

17:08.719 --> 17:10.239
Like Tieguanyin and Dahongpao.

17:10.799 --> 17:12.960
And over there
are some of our flower teas.

17:13.880 --> 17:15.880
Fresh juice is okay, right?
What do you think?

17:15.880 --> 17:16.880
All of these are popular.

17:16.880 --> 17:18.120
Are there any other options?

17:19.400 --> 17:21.400
Well, how about these over here?

17:21.600 --> 17:22.479
Do you like them?

17:23.400 --> 17:24.360
That's about it.

17:24.680 --> 17:25.440
Then I'll be off.

17:25.759 --> 17:26.600
No, wait.

17:26.920 --> 17:29.559
I think there are still some details
we need to go over.

17:29.719 --> 17:31.239
The order of guest arrivals.

17:31.279 --> 17:32.719
The color of the bouquet ribbons.

17:32.719 --> 17:34.039
And the firework placement.

17:34.039 --> 17:35.360
We need to double-check these.

17:35.680 --> 17:37.200
Weren't these already decided?

17:37.200 --> 17:38.279
Why are we doing it again?

17:38.600 --> 17:40.279
I think we need a backup plan.

17:40.400 --> 17:42.200
Otherwise, I'm afraid
Mengmeng won't like it.

17:43.279 --> 17:43.799
Okay.

17:44.400 --> 17:45.600
You review the backup plan.

17:45.600 --> 17:46.479
We'll talk later.

17:46.519 --> 17:47.640
I really need to head back.

17:48.360 --> 17:49.200
Why leave so soon?

17:50.279 --> 17:51.160
Everything is settled.

17:52.079 --> 17:54.120
A wedding isn't something
you just rush through.

17:54.120 --> 17:55.079
Didn't you take leave?

17:55.079 --> 17:55.999
Sit down.

17:55.999 --> 17:57.799
I did take leave.

17:57.799 --> 17:58.600
But I must go back.

17:58.600 --> 17:59.640
I'm worried.

17:59.920 --> 18:01.840
Besides, Huan'er is more thorough
than I am.

18:02.079 --> 18:02.600
Stop it.

18:03.479 --> 18:05.039
It's unfair to Mengmeng. Be serious.

18:05.319 --> 18:06.200
Where were you?

18:06.559 --> 18:07.840
The choice of the ribbon color.

18:08.920 --> 18:09.799
Which one did he pick?

18:10.640 --> 18:11.319
Pink.

18:12.160 --> 18:13.160
I feel the pink looks

18:13.160 --> 18:14.079
a bit tacky overall.

18:14.239 --> 18:15.799
How about the transparent one?

18:16.400 --> 18:18.840
But you just agreed
that pink looked nice.

18:18.840 --> 18:20.160
Mengmeng does love pink.

18:20.160 --> 18:22.279
But I think she'd value the design more.

18:22.640 --> 18:24.479
He could pick whatever he prefers.

18:24.479 --> 18:26.360
We must consider the overall look.

18:32.680 --> 18:34.200
Alright, no issues then.

18:34.200 --> 18:35.600
This should be good for now.

18:35.600 --> 18:36.400
I really must go.

18:36.600 --> 18:37.079
Wait.

18:37.160 --> 18:37.759
- Hold on.
- Well...

18:38.719 --> 18:39.360
Tiehan.

18:42.400 --> 18:43.039
What?

18:44.719 --> 18:46.160
We've known each other so long.

18:46.840 --> 18:49.719
Have you considered changing careers?

18:53.999 --> 18:54.920
Are you crazy?

18:56.319 --> 18:57.360
Hear me out first.

18:57.880 --> 19:01.160
Look, you're not alone anymore.

19:01.999 --> 19:03.640
If... I mean, if

19:03.719 --> 19:06.440
there's even a hint of danger
in this job,

19:07.960 --> 19:08.799
what about Mengmeng?

19:09.400 --> 19:10.440
What does that make her?

19:11.200 --> 19:11.880
Yeah.

19:13.559 --> 19:15.360
Right, well...

19:17.160 --> 19:19.960
Huan'er, since you're here too,
I'll tell you both.

19:20.880 --> 19:21.880
As you know,

19:23.239 --> 19:24.519
everyone has their role.

19:24.880 --> 19:28.160
This is the only work I know.

19:28.479 --> 19:29.319
And I'm used to it.

19:29.600 --> 19:30.640
Besides,

19:31.799 --> 19:33.920
I've discussed this with Mengmeng.

19:34.200 --> 19:35.880
She knows the risks involved.

19:37.039 --> 19:38.600
But she agreed and accepted it.

19:39.319 --> 19:40.279
She understands me.

19:40.319 --> 19:40.999
So...

19:41.479 --> 19:43.200
It's not about whether she accepts it.

19:44.319 --> 19:44.920
Hello?

19:49.319 --> 19:50.920
Got it, I'm heading over now.

19:51.479 --> 19:52.319
Did something happen?

19:52.600 --> 19:54.920
A major explosion occurred
in our precinct.

19:58.039 --> 20:01.360
So if you hadn't been here,

20:02.360 --> 20:04.079
you'd have been at the scene, right?

20:04.799 --> 20:05.640
Yes.

20:08.640 --> 20:09.719
Any casualties?

20:10.440 --> 20:11.200
None so far.

20:11.200 --> 20:12.936
I really have to go.
Let's pick a new day.

20:13.160 --> 20:13.680
Tiehan.

20:43.640 --> 20:44.319
Mengmeng.

20:45.999 --> 20:47.039
You're back.

20:49.239 --> 20:50.680
Even though you said you were safe,

20:50.680 --> 20:51.960
I still couldn't sleep.

20:51.960 --> 20:52.999
I wanted to go find you.

20:53.279 --> 20:54.039
Don't worry.

20:54.160 --> 20:55.120
I'm home now.

20:55.680 --> 20:56.200
I'm fine.

20:57.239 --> 20:58.360
How was it?

20:59.039 --> 20:59.840
Under control.

21:00.200 --> 21:01.319
The fire's contained.

21:01.559 --> 21:03.680
And luckily, no one was hurt.

21:04.640 --> 21:05.519
That's a relief.

21:06.039 --> 21:08.200
I saw the news
that it was your patrol street.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.319
I was terrified.

21:10.840 --> 21:12.279
Actually, I took the day off.

21:12.880 --> 21:14.719
You took off? What for?

21:16.440 --> 21:17.079
Secret.

21:18.519 --> 21:21.079
Secret? Since when
do you keep secrets from me?

21:21.079 --> 21:21.880
What secret?

21:22.880 --> 21:24.200
It's a secret, so...

21:24.680 --> 21:26.360
No secrets with me. Out with it.

21:26.360 --> 21:27.279
Not talking, huh?

21:27.279 --> 21:28.680
Are you telling me or not?

21:28.680 --> 21:29.519
Tell me now.

21:29.880 --> 21:31.600
Tell me. What's the secret?

21:31.600 --> 21:32.680
I said it's a secret.

21:32.719 --> 21:35.120
No. Spit it out, Hu Tiehan.

21:42.400 --> 21:43.079
Tiehan,

21:45.079 --> 21:48.479
what do you think our life
will be like after we get married?

21:51.960 --> 21:55.400
I think it's fine just like this.

21:55.719 --> 21:56.519
After work,

21:56.519 --> 21:58.200
we'll chat on the couch.

21:59.559 --> 22:00.400
We'll eat together.

22:00.799 --> 22:01.840
I'll go shopping with you.

22:03.160 --> 22:04.880
When we both have time off,

22:05.519 --> 22:06.960
we'll go out and have fun.

22:08.600 --> 22:09.440
Simple and peaceful.

22:14.160 --> 22:16.680
That's exactly
how I imagine married life too.

22:18.120 --> 22:19.360
Let's stay this way forever.

22:19.600 --> 22:20.479
Until we grow old.

22:30.400 --> 22:30.880
Cheers!

22:31.039 --> 22:31.519
Cheers!

22:36.759 --> 22:37.360
Not bad.

22:41.559 --> 22:42.239
What's wrong?

22:44.960 --> 22:46.200
Can't I just look at you?

22:46.400 --> 22:46.920
You can.

22:53.319 --> 22:54.880
They're fresh. I bought them today.

23:00.319 --> 23:00.840
Here.

23:05.759 --> 23:07.640
Alright. I'll stop teasing you.

23:13.479 --> 23:14.120
Is it good?

23:27.079 --> 23:29.160
(Since Tiehan's fate can be changed,)

23:29.840 --> 23:32.759
(that means our ending
can be rewritten too.)

23:33.799 --> 23:36.960
(But how exactly can we do it?)

24:10.640 --> 24:11.440
Mengmeng.

24:12.999 --> 24:13.680
How is it?

24:14.039 --> 24:14.840
You're stunning.

24:15.200 --> 24:16.440
This dress is gorgeous.

24:17.840 --> 24:20.200
Will Tiehan like it?

24:20.840 --> 24:21.999
Silly you.

24:22.200 --> 24:23.719
He loves everything you wear.

24:24.160 --> 24:25.120
If you wear this,

24:25.559 --> 24:27.079
he'll be over the moon.

24:31.160 --> 24:32.120
Who would've thought

24:33.079 --> 24:37.120
my best friend is getting married?

24:38.440 --> 24:39.400
Miss me already?

24:40.559 --> 24:41.840
How about you don't get married?

24:41.840 --> 24:43.239
And I'll dump Hu Tiehan.

24:43.239 --> 24:44.440
We can be together forever.

24:44.759 --> 24:46.360
Sure, I'm fine with that.

24:47.039 --> 24:50.519
But I doubt Gao Haiming would agree.

24:52.079 --> 24:53.160
I'll ask him.

24:53.160 --> 24:54.440
What if he agrees?

24:54.559 --> 24:55.680
Don't ask him.

24:55.960 --> 24:57.360
What if he actually agrees?

25:00.079 --> 25:00.840
Is that your phone?

25:01.519 --> 25:02.200
Is it Tiehan?

25:03.120 --> 25:04.120
Check if it's him.

25:07.039 --> 25:08.160
Hello? Tiehan?

25:08.440 --> 25:10.400
I tried on a stunning wedding dress.

25:10.519 --> 25:11.039
When will...

25:47.880 --> 25:48.719
How is he?

25:50.400 --> 25:51.039
I'm sorry.

25:51.640 --> 25:52.680
We did our best.

26:24.960 --> 26:25.519
Mengmeng.

27:01.960 --> 27:02.920
Mengmeng, I like you.

27:04.200 --> 27:07.799
I've liked you since forever.

27:09.600 --> 27:11.120
I am a bit touched.

27:12.079 --> 27:13.079
I feel so happy.

27:13.559 --> 27:14.360
It feels unreal.

27:14.920 --> 27:18.200
From now on, whatever you like,

27:18.719 --> 27:19.719
I'll do my best

27:20.039 --> 27:21.079
to make it happen.

27:21.680 --> 27:22.880
I promise.

27:23.319 --> 27:27.279
We've missed each other for a long time.

27:28.960 --> 27:29.799
But thankfully,

27:32.039 --> 27:35.079
in the end, we are the ones
who stand by each other.

27:36.319 --> 27:37.559
Every time before,

27:38.719 --> 27:41.239
you were the brave one who found me.

27:42.632 --> 27:44.104
This time, I want to be brave too.

27:48.799 --> 27:49.440
Mengmeng,

27:50.200 --> 27:51.279
will you marry me?

27:52.600 --> 27:54.799
What do you think our life will be like

27:54.920 --> 27:55.999
after we get married?

27:56.759 --> 28:00.039
I think it's fine just like this.

28:00.279 --> 28:01.079
(After work,)

28:01.079 --> 28:02.880
(we'll chat on the couch.)

28:04.160 --> 28:05.160
(We'll eat together.)

28:05.440 --> 28:06.559
(I'll go shopping with you.)

28:07.680 --> 28:09.519
(When we both have time off,)

28:10.239 --> 28:11.680
(we'll go out and have fun.)

28:12.400 --> 28:13.352
(Simple and peaceful.)

28:13.799 --> 28:16.279
That's exactly
how I imagine married life too.

28:17.719 --> 28:18.960
Let's stay this way forever.

28:19.239 --> 28:20.039
Until we grow old.

28:50.728 --> 28:53.711
♪Entwined worries linger♪

28:54.920 --> 28:57.691
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

28:59.592 --> 29:05.505
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

29:07.302 --> 29:10.362
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

29:11.528 --> 29:14.980
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

29:15.976 --> 29:21.502
♪Until the world's end♪

29:23.912 --> 29:27.708
♪If I could♪

29:28.296 --> 29:31.112
♪Keep loving you♪

29:32.136 --> 29:34.536
♪Hearing two hearts♪

29:34.536 --> 29:39.452
♪Beating together♪

29:40.424 --> 29:44.288
♪If I could♪

29:44.288 --> 29:47.528
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

29:48.584 --> 29:55.909
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

30:22.640 --> 30:23.799
What's meant to happen

30:25.840 --> 30:27.200
will happen, right?

30:35.840 --> 30:36.640
It's okay.

30:39.519 --> 30:40.479
No matter what happens,

30:42.319 --> 30:43.440
no matter the outcome,

30:44.719 --> 30:45.759
if we love each other,

30:47.360 --> 30:49.600
there'll be no regrets, right?

30:51.479 --> 30:52.799
How could there be no regrets?

30:54.559 --> 30:56.759
I refuse to let our story end like that.

30:59.160 --> 30:59.799
Silly.

31:01.640 --> 31:03.880
No one can accompany another
through their entire life.

31:06.479 --> 31:08.079
But in the limited time we have,

31:10.279 --> 31:11.592
if we've truly loved each other,

31:12.999 --> 31:15.079
even if we never meet again,

31:18.600 --> 31:20.880
those memories
will warm the rest of our lives.

31:21.840 --> 31:22.440
Right?

31:35.479 --> 31:36.559
Then what if...

31:40.279 --> 31:41.759
if we were to part ways too,

31:43.759 --> 31:45.200
what would you want to do with me?

31:48.999 --> 31:49.999
It's just a hypothetical.

31:52.239 --> 31:53.759
Suppose our time together

31:54.719 --> 31:59.079
was down to the last 24 hours.

32:01.200 --> 32:01.960
What would you do?

32:17.559 --> 32:21.880
Then... then we'd do everything
we possibly could.

32:22.999 --> 32:25.200
We'd cherish each moment
as if it were our last.

32:26.400 --> 32:26.960
Okay?

32:51.880 --> 32:52.799
Ms. Lin Huan'er,

32:54.079 --> 32:55.759
I've decided where we're going today.

32:56.239 --> 32:57.360
I have a few little wishes.

32:57.600 --> 32:58.696
Can you help fulfill them?

33:01.704 --> 33:05.860
♪Timelines, tangled♪

33:06.440 --> 33:10.085
♪I boarded a rickety time machine♪

33:10.085 --> 33:13.509
♪My heart is pounding♪

33:13.509 --> 33:17.477
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

33:17.477 --> 33:21.607
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

33:22.245 --> 33:26.215
♪Your smile is shimmering like stars♪

33:26.215 --> 33:31.631
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

33:32.851 --> 33:40.405
♪Love's time machine,
flies, flies, flies♪

33:40.405 --> 33:48.419
♪Through centuries, just to meet you♪

33:48.419 --> 33:56.420
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

33:56.420 --> 34:00.773
♪Streaking across the sky♪

34:01.669 --> 34:10.565
♪Just to hold you♪

34:20.357 --> 34:22.960
♪Old times, pass slowly♪

34:22.960 --> 34:24.720
So your first wish is to recreate

34:24.960 --> 34:27.039
a cup of Coffee
on the Left Bank by the Seine?

34:28.720 --> 34:31.360
Making coffee for someone you love
is a joyful thing, isn't it?

34:33.999 --> 34:35.199
Try it. Is the taste the same?

34:40.800 --> 34:41.400
It's the same.

34:42.720 --> 34:45.840
Taste is the most enduring sense
in human memory.

34:52.039 --> 34:53.679
I'll remember this taste forever.

34:55.353 --> 35:03.110
♪Love's time machine keeps on turning♪

35:04.199 --> 35:04.960
Have you decided?

35:05.199 --> 35:06.159
Where are we going next?

35:07.519 --> 35:08.119
I've decided.

35:08.639 --> 35:09.920
Another place we've been before.

35:09.920 --> 35:19.141
♪Just to hold you♪

35:21.599 --> 35:22.999
Why did you improve so much?

35:23.240 --> 35:24.880
Did you secretly practice
behind my back?

35:25.360 --> 35:26.119
No way.

35:26.360 --> 35:27.720
I was hoping you could teach me.

35:28.440 --> 35:30.720
You want to relive
our ice dancing, right?

35:31.440 --> 35:33.440
And also to relive
the suspension bridge effect.

35:34.880 --> 35:36.119
I've always wanted to ask.

35:37.199 --> 35:38.679
When we rode the motorbike back then,

35:38.679 --> 35:40.559
did the suspension bridge effect work?

35:44.119 --> 35:44.760
Guess.

35:46.360 --> 35:46.840
It did.

35:48.960 --> 35:49.479
It didn't?

36:24.440 --> 36:25.119
Here we go.

36:34.199 --> 36:35.679
- It's okay.
- It's okay.

36:43.199 --> 36:43.920
It'll work.

37:02.639 --> 37:03.639
Give me another chance.

37:03.920 --> 37:04.800
It'll work this time.

37:25.679 --> 37:26.199
You take it.

37:29.159 --> 37:29.880
Do you like it?

37:29.880 --> 37:30.440
Yes.

37:32.720 --> 37:33.360
Then let's go.

37:38.020 --> 37:40.191
(Photo Booth
Creating My Life Memories)

37:41.999 --> 37:43.039
I want to pick this one.

37:43.400 --> 37:44.360
And this one.

37:45.288 --> 37:46.440
Can you do a finger heart?

37:46.800 --> 37:47.599
What's that?

37:48.400 --> 37:48.999
Like this.

37:57.679 --> 37:59.639
What should we do for the last set?

38:00.479 --> 38:01.800
Let me choose the last one.

38:02.280 --> 38:02.880
Okay.

38:20.159 --> 38:23.199
(I wish I could grow old with you.)

38:25.639 --> 38:27.039
(But I won't be able to.)

38:30.840 --> 38:31.400
Come on.

38:54.360 --> 38:56.559
So this is what we look like
when we're old.

38:59.679 --> 39:02.440
I don't think you'll look like this
when you're old.

39:08.679 --> 39:09.599
When you're old,

39:13.280 --> 39:14.119
you'll look the same.

39:29.840 --> 39:30.440
I'm hungry.

39:30.440 --> 39:31.400
Let's go eat.

39:32.119 --> 39:32.599
Let's go.

39:36.872 --> 39:39.855
♪Entwined worries linger♪

39:41.064 --> 39:43.835
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

39:45.736 --> 39:51.649
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

39:53.446 --> 39:56.506
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

39:57.672 --> 40:01.124
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

40:02.120 --> 40:07.646
♪Until the world's end♪

40:10.056 --> 40:13.852
♪If I could♪

40:14.440 --> 40:17.256
♪Keep loving you♪

40:18.280 --> 40:20.680
♪Hearing two hearts♪

40:20.680 --> 40:25.596
♪Beating together♪

40:26.568 --> 40:30.432
♪If I could♪

40:30.432 --> 40:33.672
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

40:34.728 --> 40:42.053
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

40:43.112 --> 40:46.056
♪Entwined worries linger♪

40:47.304 --> 40:50.056
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

40:51.912 --> 40:57.692
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

40:59.624 --> 41:02.649
